# Walkthrough - Phase 1: Role-Based Authentication

We have implemented Phase 1: **Role-Based Authentication** for the Smart Placement Assistant project across all three roles: **Student**, **Company/Recruiter**, and **Admin**.

---

## 1. Summary of Changes

### Backend Security & Architecture
- **[User.js](file:///c:/Users/Admin/OneDrive/Desktop/Smart-Placement-Assistant/backend/models/User.js)**:
  - Validated role enum strictly for `["student", "company", "admin"]`.
  - Added schema method `matchPassword(enteredPassword)` using bcrypt.
  - Added `isActive` field with default `true`.
- **[authMiddleware.js](file:///c:/Users/Admin/OneDrive/Desktop/Smart-Placement-Assistant/backend/middleware/authMiddleware.js)**:
  - `protect`: Verifies Bearer JWT, resolves user, attaches safe user object without password to `req.user`.
  - `authorize(...roles)`: Enforces role permissions, returning `403 Forbidden` if user role is not permitted.
- **[authController.js](file:///c:/Users/Admin/OneDrive/Desktop/Smart-Placement-Assistant/backend/controllers/authController.js)**:
  - Enforced security on public registration: only `student` and `company` roles can be registered publicly. Admin self-registration is blocked.
  - Generates JWT containing `{ id, role }` without exposing secrets or credentials.
- **[db.js](file:///c:/Users/Admin/OneDrive/Desktop/Smart-Placement-Assistant/backend/config/db.js)**:
  - Added automatic seed check for default demo accounts (`admin@placement.edu`, `recruiter@google.com`, `vedant@student.edu`) upon MongoDB connection, ensuring demo logins work in both Atlas and Memory Store modes.

### Route Protection & Ownership Permissions
- **[jobRoutes.js](file:///c:/Users/Admin/OneDrive/Desktop/Smart-Placement-Assistant/backend/routes/jobRoutes.js)**:
  - `POST /api/jobs`: Restricted to `company` and `admin` (`authorize("company", "admin")`). Students receive `403 Forbidden`.
  - `PUT /api/jobs/:id`: Restricted to `company` and `admin`.
  - `DELETE /api/jobs/:id`: Restricted to `company` and `admin`.
  - `GET /api/jobs/company/my-jobs`: Restricted to `company` and `admin`.
- **[jobController.js](file:///c:/Users/Admin/OneDrive/Desktop/Smart-Placement-Assistant/backend/controllers/jobController.js)**:
  - Implemented **ownership check** in `updateJob` and `deleteJob`: Company accounts can only update/delete jobs created by their organization (`job.companyId === req.user._id`). Admins can update/delete any job.
- **[resumeRoutes.js](file:///c:/Users/Admin/OneDrive/Desktop/Smart-Placement-Assistant/backend/routes/resumeRoutes.js)**:
  - Upload, get resume, and delete resume restricted to `student` and `admin`.
- **[adminRoutes.js](file:///c:/Users/Admin/OneDrive/Desktop/Smart-Placement-Assistant/backend/routes/adminRoutes.js)**:
  - Overview and students directory restricted strictly to `admin`.
- **[companyRoutes.js](file:///c:/Users/Admin/OneDrive/Desktop/Smart-Placement-Assistant/backend/routes/companyRoutes.js)**:
  - Recruiter statistics restricted to `company` and `admin`.
- **[savedJobRoutes.js](file:///c:/Users/Admin/OneDrive/Desktop/Smart-Placement-Assistant/backend/routes/savedJobRoutes.js)**:
  - Saved job toggling and listing restricted to `student` and `admin`.

### Frontend & Dashboards
- **[js/api.js](file:///c:/Users/Admin/OneDrive/Desktop/Smart-Placement-Assistant/js/api.js)**:
  - Enhanced `requireAuth(allowedRoles)` with automatic redirection and role notification feedback.
- **[company-dashboard.html](file:///c:/Users/Admin/OneDrive/Desktop/Smart-Placement-Assistant/company-dashboard.html) & [company-dashboard.js](file:///c:/Users/Admin/OneDrive/Desktop/Smart-Placement-Assistant/js/company-dashboard.js)**:
  - Created Recruiter Portal protected with `requireAuth(["company", "admin"])`.
  - Displays recruiter metrics (Active Postings, Total Applicants, Shortlisted, Interviews).
  - Includes job management table with delete action and modal form to publish new jobs directly via `POST /api/jobs`.
- **[admin-dashboard.html](file:///c:/Users/Admin/OneDrive/Desktop/Smart-Placement-Assistant/admin-dashboard.html) & [admin-dashboard.js](file:///c:/Users/Admin/OneDrive/Desktop/Smart-Placement-Assistant/js/admin-dashboard.js)**:
  - Created Admin Portal protected with `requireAuth(["admin"])`.
  - Displays placement metrics (Registered Students, Company Partners, Active Jobs, Placement Rate).
  - Includes student directory table.
- **[login.html](file:///c:/Users/Admin/OneDrive/Desktop/Smart-Placement-Assistant/login.html) & [js/login.js](file:///c:/Users/Admin/OneDrive/Desktop/Smart-Placement-Assistant/js/login.js)**:
  - One-click demo login buttons for Student, Recruiter, and Admin.
  - Redirects dynamically to the correct dashboard (`dashboard.html`, `company-dashboard.html`, `admin-dashboard.html`).
- **[jobs.html](file:///c:/Users/Admin/OneDrive/Desktop/Smart-Placement-Assistant/jobs.html) & [js/jobs.js](file:///c:/Users/Admin/OneDrive/Desktop/Smart-Placement-Assistant/js/jobs.js)**:
  - Updated dashboard buttons to point to the appropriate role dashboard for logged-in users.

